  m_dialogues:
  - HasAudio: 1
    DelayBeforeTyping: 0
    TypingDelay: 0
    WhoSpoke: You
    SentPrefabRef: {fileID: 0}
    Content: So you don't know anything about this weapon?
    TriggerAfterThisLine: {fileID: 0}
  - HasAudio: 1
    DelayBeforeTyping: 0.1
    TypingDelay: 0.5
    WhoSpoke: Aria
    SentPrefabRef: {fileID: 0}
    Content: Nope
    TriggerAfterThisLine: {fileID: 0}
  - HasAudio: 1
    DelayBeforeTyping: 0.7
    TypingDelay: 3
    WhoSpoke: You
    SentPrefabRef: {fileID: 0}
    Content: 'If so, we might have a problem here.


      We found your fingerprints
      on the bat.


      Why might that be?'
    TriggerAfterThisLine: {fileID: 0}
  - HasAudio: 1
    DelayBeforeTyping: 0.2
    TypingDelay: 0.1
    WhoSpoke: Aria
    SentPrefabRef: {fileID: 0}
    Content: WHAT
    TriggerAfterThisLine: {fileID: 0}
  - HasAudio: 1
    DelayBeforeTyping: 5
    TypingDelay: 10
    WhoSpoke: Aria
    SentPrefabRef: {fileID: 0}
    Content: 'How


      This is nonsense! I never touch anything like this


      Why
      would I even have a bat


      I''m being framed I''m sure of it!


      I
      haven''t piss off any baseballers, it must be some of my haters


      they''d
      do anything to ruin me'
    TriggerAfterThisLine: {fileID: 0}
  - HasAudio: 1
    DelayBeforeTyping: 0.1
    TypingDelay: 3
    WhoSpoke: Aria
    SentPrefabRef: {fileID: 0}
    Content: 'There must be a mistake with your results right?


      Did you get
      the correct fingerprints?'
    TriggerAfterThisLine: {fileID: 0}
  - HasAudio: 1
    DelayBeforeTyping: 0.1
    TypingDelay: 1
    WhoSpoke: Aria
    SentPrefabRef: {fileID: 0}
    Content: 'I can''t believe this


      You have the wrong person!


      I
      have nothing to do with this!'
    TriggerAfterThisLine: {fileID: 0}
